{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫真人騷《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集引爆全城熱話，陳星妤（Yvette）行使特權換入相識多年的李爾晨（Kyl …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫真人騷《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集引爆全城熱話，陳星妤（Yvette）行使特權換入相識多年的李爾晨（Kyle），觸發二人於鏡頭前淚崩剖白這段長達11年「友達以上」的遺憾過往。節目播出後，Kyle 於社交平台 Threads 發文表白兼為女方送上祝福，並公開二人昔日的青澀合照，隨即引來大批網民湧入留言熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>曬青澀舊照留下11年深情告白</h2>\n<p>Kyle 在 Threads 上載了當年與 Yvette 在甜品店的舊照，相中兩人面露燦爛笑容，神情青澀親密。Kyle 更留下充滿遺憾卻又真摯的字句：「你未忘 我未忘 猶勝伴在旁。十一年 不敢提起 未敢忘記 你一定要幸福。」文末他更直接標註了 Yvette 的社交帳號 @yvette.cc，公開將埋藏心底多年的心聲展露人前。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724421949647_3985918846ae81f3c7c3e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"86d7365d-10e6-4168-80c3-35f34f6d93d8.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724421949647_3985918846ae81f3c7c3e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民心痛嘆「做足11年兵」：咁靚仔都要當兵？</h2>\n<p>貼文曝光後，網民的反應相當兩極，不少人戥 Kyle 感到心痛與不值，直指這段關係宛如「做足11年兵」<b><strong>，</strong></b> 網民紛紛感嘆「咁靚仔都要做兵🥹」、「做10年兵？！無錢點會簡你…」、「陰公，好仔無好下場架，建議唔好咁專一，包你有女朋友」、「一個士兵，司令如好好帶領，未來或會榮獲晉升五顆星」。亦有網民留言苦勸他不要再深陷其中：「師兄希望你唔好再沉落去，唔好做兵。人地都講左佢係想你陪喺佢身邊，佢冇話想同你喺埋一齊」、「唔好做兵呀，快啲搵過個」、「何必」、「咁勢利恐怖女仔，早走！」。</p>\n<h2>力撐放膽跨前一步 vs 驚嘆女方「外貌進化」</h2>\n<p>除了同情與勸退外，亦有部分網民認為二人當年情愫極深，紛紛留言力撐 Kyle 鼓起勇氣追求幸福：「如果擺唔低就不如誠實d一齊，無謂等老左嘅自己後悔，拋開一切，幸福先最重要」、「哩d相跟談了有什麼區別」、「第一張咁都無路？」。</p>\n<p>與此同時，隨着二人當年的合照曝光，部分網民將焦點轉移至外貌變化上，留言指：「個女都唔同樣ge……進化左咁多….」、「佢個樣係咪照住Jessica調整😂」，更有人打趣表示：「但男人好似退化左」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179354157447660455_9622432866ae745c6ab3e0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179354157447660455_9622432866ae745c6ab3e0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179354155002446876_42478206ae745ae696c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179354155002446876_42478206ae745ae696c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳星妤此時突然控制不住情緒哽咽落淚，坦言好少有人在身邊陪伴多年，入行及人生重大決定都會詢問對方意見，期望這段關係可以一直維持下去。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724554866820_4204917136ae81f3dbc7d0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"883080586_18635903860017387_5139677892251616819_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724554866820_4204917136ae81f3dbc7d0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724652963376_20133716946ae81f3eba3ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"884669346_18635903872017387_2156254292879566727_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724652963376_20133716946ae81f3eba3ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724823916097_10923555266ae81f406bdbb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"881593654_18635903890017387_1493573474564906306_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724823916097_10923555266ae81f406bdbb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724982282450_14833104956ae81f42033c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"886677168_18635903917017387_7997469906763038676_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724982282450_14833104956ae81f42033c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359725131183438_6466946866ae81f4374e97.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"885265091_18635903881017387_5967313547001938253_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359725131183438_6466946866ae81f4374e97.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359725210939642_1976528266ae81f444745c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"883033637_18635903863017387_146180555056439082_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359725210939642_1976528266ae81f444745c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%8e%e7%88%be%e6%99%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李爾晨</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e6%98%9f%e5%a6%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳星妤</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3534392\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 2 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:08.044286+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1393,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:27:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:38:58.773388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:32.373083+00:00","content_hash":"8e4603e172a9b939dd64441c3b4fa958f6e2a1489de62e4b57ee43e68a6139ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}